// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Doctor_Creed 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Doctor Creed 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2881423985" "Doctor Creed"
// ProfessionString :
"P4003410802" "Mad Scientist"
// DescriptionString :
"P669829718" "Doctor Creed is a mad scientist who has taken to researching the Infected on Mercy Island in hopes of unlocking the source of their power. It is rumored he was a former SERAPH scientist until he tired of their moral and ethical imperatives."
// HelloString :
"P4080245313" "Salutations, {VillainName}."
// HelloString :
"P2182149745" "Have you come to assist me with my experimentation?"
// HelloString :
"P1029282611" "Come! Let us do SCIENCE!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2473879985" "You are not worthy enough to bask in the genius of Doctor Creed!"
// FirstVisitString :
"P2462672912" "Ah, you must be {VillainName}! I am the infamous Doctor Creed! You may have heard of my genius... I was once part of the illustrious brain trust at SERAPH until I learned what fools my so-called peers were! They tossed around words like 'ethics' and 'morals'... bah! Such things are minor obstacles on the path leading to true breakthroughs in SCIENCE!<br><br>I've been studying the Infected on Mercy Island for awhile, researching these living zombie-men who have become nothing more than pathetic rejects of humanity. They believe they can gain power by subsisting on the toxic cesspool waters of Mercy Island - and you've seen the results of that! However, I believe at the root of their madness lies a grain of truth, the ability for an Infected to become a true super-powered being! If there is power to be gained through experimentation on these Infected, then the genius of Doctor Creed will find it!"
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1558964530" "Your utility is at an end, {VillainName} - I can continue my experiments without your assistance. Why don't you speak with Mikey the Ear or Drea the Hook in Port Oakes?"
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3979408458" "You're far to busy, {VillainName}. Doctor Creed demands your full attention!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3294249479" "What? You think you can be of assistance to the illustrious Doctor Creed? Bah! Come talk to me when you're at least Threat Level {Level}! I don't have time to baby-sit you otherwise!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P852452176" "You may prove yourself to be something more than a lackey yet, {VillainName}! Let us keep in closer touch: call me on my cell phone if you need to speak with me.<br><br>Check out what my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store</a> has to offer. "
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P3951581605" "Most impressive, {VillainName}! Most impressive!<br><br>I have more things in my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store</a> if you require further assistance."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P3411083629" "I don't need a lab assistant anymore. I suggest you head over to Port Oakes and speak with Mikey the Ear or Drea the Hook."
// LocationString :
"P2613846116" "Mercy Island"
// IntroString :
"P3624257970" "I know this guy name Doctor Creed here on Mercy. He's a bit of a nut, but he's always looking for volunteers to help him with his 'experiments' on the Infected."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P191566264" "Choose Doctor Creed"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2090281754" "Be prepared to face a lot more of those Infected freaks. Doctor Creed seems to be obsessed with them."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P21582771" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</A> you should talk to."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P992132903" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</A> you should speak with."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


