// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Fire_Wire 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Fire Wire 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1462234187" "Fire Wire"
// ProfessionString :
"P236945301" "Villain"
// DescriptionString :
"P2184352947" "Fire Wire is one of the many villains who inhabit Mercy Island. Fire Wire tends to boast and brag about most of his accomplishments, earning him the ire of any competing villains. However, he seems to have some semblance of bite behind his bark, or else he wouldn't still be alive today."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P2898822673" "Things are about to get crazy!"
// HelloString :
"P986212792" "I'm the wire to the fire, the Fire Wire!"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P4179060066" "Yo, bugger off, I ain't got time for this, I got big PLANS in the making!"
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4092027430" "TEXT"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3231299045" "Fire Wire is... an interesting man. He is a known villain amongst Mercy, due to his bragging. There have been rumors that he has a big plan in store, big enough that he isn't running his loud mouth about it."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2415735906" "Meet with Fire Wire"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P471269320" "Keep your eye on Fire Wire, {HeroName}. He may be pompous, but he is as cutthroat as anyone else around here."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page AnnoyedFireWire Text :
"P653398025" "<i>Well well well</i>! It's {Hero.gender=male Mr.|Miss} 'Oh, if you want to rely on Arachnos, be my guest!'. Been a while, a real looong while.<br><br>I heard aboutcha from that Kuzmin guy. Looks you and and me are gonna be workin' together now, compadre!<br><br>Now, I'm gonna to prove to ya that I <i>don't</i> need Arachnos to be backin' me up. 'Cause see, I got myself a <i>plan</i>, and if you wanna help me out with it, we can <i>split</i> the <i>rewards</i>, if you get my drift."
// Answer Text :
"P3620145366" "What exactly is your plan?"
// Page InsultedFireWire Text :
"P2066811769" "Well slap my face, <i>look</i> who just walked into town! The same {Hero.gender=male guy|gal} who told me back in Galaxy that we didn't have anything in common is now tryin' to <i>work</i> together with me!<br><br>THAT is a REAL hoot! But you know somethin'? I got mercy, old Fire Wire has <i>plenty</i> of sympathy and forgiveness. As long as you and me can get along.<br><br>See, I got a big job planned, a <i>big</i> job. You and me, we're gonna be richer than rich at the end of this. And we split what we get right down the middle, you dig? You can trust old Fire Wire with this plan."
// Answer Text :
"P1908189546" "Ugh. Right. OK. What is this plan?"
// Page FriendedFireWire Text :
"P3594182905" "HEY! {HeroName}! Been too long {Hero.gender=male man|girl}! I was hopin' you'd be stoppin' on by. You and me are gonna light this place UP!<br><br>I got this plan, see, it's gonna make us crazy rich. You and me, <i>swimming</i> in money!<br><br>We're gonna split this right down the middle, fifty fifty. No harm, no foul, right? Now I gotta ask ya, are you READY to hear this <i>grand</i> plan of mine? It's for you and me only!"
// Answer Text :
"P2089213927" "Sure, what's this plan of yours?"
// Page DontKnowFireWire Text :
"P2389293273" "What's up? Name's <color yellow>Fire Wire</color>. I'm the best lookin', best talkin', best fire usin' guy this side of Mercy.<br><br>I heard you're tougher than tough. That's the kinda person I need on this job I'm plannin'. This thing is gonna be <i>big</i> {HeroName}. We're talkin' lots of money big.<br><br>The plan is sorta complex, but it's gonna net us a <i>ton</i> of cash when it comes through. What do you say? You ready for some wild times?"
// Answer Text :
"P1761684065" "... Sure. What's this plan that you have?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Killed Text :
"P2710052005" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Fire Wire.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Spared Text :
"P2845105307" "Hey so, uh, thanks for the whole not killing me thing and all. I swear, I ain't gonna backstab ya again. That's all behind me!"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Spared Text :
"P151417006" "Seems like you got a ton of stuff you're already working on, {HeroName}. I ain't gonna start chatting you up 'till you've got it all taken care of."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


