// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Kalinda 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Kalinda 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2068388224" "Kalinda"
// ProfessionString :
"P1465041419" "Fortunata"
// DescriptionString :
"P2080681739" "As an Arachnos Fortunata, it is Kalinda's task to keep an eye on all new arrivals to Mercy Island. That doesn't mean she's on their side. She is evaluating each new resident for signs of greatness, and for signs of weakness. Kalinda can set you on the path to greatness, or she can make sure you're never heard from again. There are only two things she believes in: the glory of Arachnos, and the survival of the fittest."
// HelloString :
"P895086828" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's see how fit you truly are.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P539155773" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I hope you can live up to this challenge.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P272836495" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You're about to be tested.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1764438374" "You are not one of my charges. Go."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3479531564" "{VillainName}, yes? Interesting. It may well be that you are one of the people we seek. In case you're wondering why you're out here in the open air instead of enjoying the fine dining at Zigursky Prison, you have me to thank. I arranged it. You see, some of your fellow prisoners are special. Perhaps even you. <br><br>I have foreseen that some members of this group will rise up to usher in a bold new future for Arachnos. Of course, if you think you're one of them, you'll have to prove it. Soon. <br><br>First, though, I recommend you present yourself to Arbiter Diaz. He is marked on your map. The Arbiters oversee difficulties within Arachnos, and help to quell squabbles that might threaten the security of the organization. Remember: Arachnos is beset by in-fighting among its many factions, but the Arbiters are above all that chaos. Despite all our divisiveness and squabbling, the Arbiters must never be harmed. Go to him, and see if he can help you on your path."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1593586564" "I will no longer test you personally, {VillainName}. But I will keep my eye on you."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P3326298096" "You come to me with three jobs already, and expect me to get in line? You're not doing much to convince me that you're special."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3427458420" "There are more tests in your future, {VillainName}, but not until you get to Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2664304593" "You're doing well. I'd like to see more of what you're capable of. You may avail yourself of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store's</a> considerable resources. Please take this communicator, and check in regularly."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1835191162" "I am impressed, {VillainName}. I think I can assure you that, no matter what, Arachnos will have its eye upon you for a good long while. If you want to perform well, I recommend you outfit yourself with the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1199114537" "I'm still watching you, {VillainName}, but our work together is done."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P1093403444" "You should introduce yourself to the Fortunata known as Kalinda. Don't be shy, walk right up. I'm sure she'll be interested in your future."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P908045086" "Choose Kalinda"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P692851595" "Kalinda is a harsh woman. Never forget that her loyalty is to Arachnos, not to you."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1712145455" "There is one who will test you further. His real name is unknown in these parts; I, along with everyone else, refer to him by his soubriquet: <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Mongoose.</a> He will throw you into some of the darkest pits this island has to offer. Come out of them alive, and your future may be secured."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P383005437" "There are <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>those</a> who would test you further."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


