// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Lt_Harris 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Lt. Harris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1160488644" "Lt. Harris"
// ProfessionString :
"P1123732794" "Longbow Turncoat"
// DescriptionString :
"P3818440883" "Lieutenant Bill Harris was a decorated soldier within the ranks of Longbow. He has participated in several operations, including the defense of Independence Port from a Rikti invasion.<br><br>He was a dedicated soldier, but some say that there is something <i>off</i> with him. Many were concerned when he was shipped off to help with the operations in Mercy, but he insisted it was the place he 'had to be'. Soldiers whisper it has something to do with his feelings for a certain Lt. Page."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P1524561103" "Longbow will remember the name Bill Harris!"
// HelloString :
"P891807020" "Linda Page will wish she had never crossed me."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1768416145" "I can't be seen talking to you. We'd best part ways."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroString :
"P3353365301" "Lt. Harris is a member of Longbow. Or, I should say, a very recent <i>former</i> member of Longbow. He seems to have a very strong desire for vengeance against the group.<br><br>I think you would get along quite well with him."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3619507064" "Meet with Lt. Harris."
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1513697346" "The man seems to be very focused on following this feeling of hatred. I would be careful that his feelings do not suddenly sway into a different direction.<br><br>When you're ready to assault Fort Darwin, I shall send some of the prototype Infected your way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Harris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page IntroducedByFire Text :
"P2802367540" "Longbow will pay for what they've done to me!"
// Answer Text :
"P1984122306" "Ask about available missions"
// Page Regular Text :
"P115801425" "{HeroName}, good to see you. My name is <color yellow>Bill Harris</color>. I am a lieutenant in <color yellow>Longbow</color>.<br><br>I've been in touch with officials in Arachnos, who have given my information to Dr. Weber.<br><br>I'm here to ask for your help in stopping the Longbow occupation of Fort Darwin."
// Answer Text :
"P2498983465" "Why is a lieutenant in Longbow trying to bring it down?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4219058705" "I'm out for <i>revenge</i>, {HeroName}, plain and simple.<br><br>I was wronged by a woman named <color yellow>Linda Page</color>, a fellow lieutenant. I was made a <i>fool</i>, {HeroName}, <i>mocked</i> by all in Longbow!<br><br>Everything I worked for was destroyed by that woman, and I intend to make her and <i>everyone</i> pay. I imagine that having Longbow out of the way will help <i>you</i> as well, so I propose that you and I work together. What do you say?"
// Answer Text :
"P776524055" "Alright, Harris, I'm in. You better not pull anything."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - NoTasksRemaining 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Killed Text :
"P1001203625" "<color orange>You're unable to reach Lt. Harris.</color>"
// Answer Text :
// Page Spared Text :
"P323979372" ""I'm not too sure what is left for me to do now, {HeroName}. Perhap I will just become a mercenary... we shall see."
// Answer Text :

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - PlayerBusy 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Spared Text :
"P4236534833" "You've got too many schemes right now, {HeroName}. Let's talk some more once you're free."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


