// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Matthew_Burke 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Matthew Burke 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P886977873" "Matthew Burke"
// ProfessionString :
"P497416018" "Mercenary"
// DescriptionString :
"P1731185810" "Matthew Burke's been around the Rogue Isles a long time. Long enough to see Arachnos grow in power, and long enough to resent their interference in his work. Most people on the Isles tend to roll over when Arachnos gets too close to their territory, but not Matt. Instead, he's learned to fight back. With his network of contacts and his long line of experience in the dirty business of mercenary work, Matt's managed to stay one step ahead of any Arachnos assassins who might want to take him down. How long this can last is anybody's guess."
// HelloString :
"P171746757" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>We've got a job.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P4150922428" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's work for you.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1931924701" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Let's get down to serious business.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P1755564671" "Keep walkin', I don't want to draw any attention to myself."
// FirstVisitString :
"P1376447635" "{VillainName}. Interesting handle. I can tell one thing about you already: you're nobody's puppet. That's why you're here with me instead of toadying up to Kalinda. I can get you some jobs and help you make your way in the Rogue Isles. Just remember: you have to decide how much to deal with Arachnos. Don't let them decide for you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P283681080" "I've got nothing more for you, {VillainName}. Try another contact."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P656149286" "You're too busy to go looking for more work."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P4013007832" "I've got something, but I'm not trusting it to anyone below Threat Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3369969256" "You're earning my respect, and that's saying something. Take my private comm number. And help yourself to the best <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements</a> I have to offer."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1834382800" "{VillainName}, I'm starting to think this is the beginning of a beautiful friendship. You need <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements,</a> I'm your guy."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2552102424" "I've got nothing you can help with, {VillainName}. Go on now. You've got bigger fish to fry."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P3605086589" "You may want to look up Matthew Burke in Mercy Island. I probably shouldn't even be mentioning him to you; he's not exactly one of Arachnos' best friends. But he knows his way around the Rogue Isles, that's for sure."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P1007939797" "Choose Matthew Burke"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P985739532" "Matthew's an odd one, but he can get you started in Mercy Island."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P3589491634" "There's a rather odd fellow I'd like you to meet: <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>Doctor Creed.</a> He's a strange man, but he knows a lot about the Infected, and he's looking for a lab assistant."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2992244229" "There are some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> who would like to meet you."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


