// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Mongoose 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Mongoose 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2863408516" "Mongoose"
// ProfessionString :
"P2119054070" "Snake Exterminator"
// DescriptionString :
"P1688262704" "Mongoose gained his name fighting Snakes in Darwin's Landing. He's a tough customer but knows Mercy Island quite well, so he's worth talking to if you want to learn a few things about the Darwin's Landing and Mercy neighborhoods."
// HelloString :
"P3331928314" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>'Sup, {VillainName}?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3155113629" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Yo, {VillainName}.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P835737388" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Got something for you, {VillainName}.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3243319210" "You want to talk to me, you best talk to Kalinda first. Now get out of here before I feed you to the Snakes! "
// FirstVisitString :
"P2593195729" "{VillainName}, eh? You must be one of the new arrivals to Mercy. They call me Mongoose, because I'm the best at what I do - taking down Snakes! If you want to survive on Mercy, you best learn what I got to teach you. If you're tough enough, maybe you'll move up the food chain in the Rogue Isles. Or maybe you'll end up dead in a snake pit. I don't really care - I get paid either way."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3931923198" "I got nothin' more for ya, {VillainName}. Why don't you talk to Mikey the Ear or Drea the Hook in Port Oakes? They might have some heists for you to pull off. If you do enough to impress them, they might introduce you to someone new."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P994081691" "Why you comin' to me? I heard you got your hands full already."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P699405170" "Listen, wimp. You ain't nothin' to me! Talk to me when you're at least Threat Level {Level}!"
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2368849196" "You might just survive Mercy yet, {VillainName}. I might just have something new in my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store</a> for you. Take my cell number. I'll do what I can to help you out."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P4187542650" "You're tougher than I gave you credit for, {VillainName}! I can respect that. Look around my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>store;</a> see if something is worth your time."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P2497563913" "What are you still hangin' around me for? You want to earn a rep, you got to get yourself off Mercy as soon as you can. Why don't you talk to Mikey the Ear or Drea the Hook in Port Oakes? They can set you up with some work. If you can pull off a few jobs for them, they'll set you up with someone new."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P104902486" "There is one in Mercy who is known as Mongoose. He's a professional exterminator. Arachnos pays him to keep the Snake population in check, and to hire new arrivals to clean out Snake pits for him. Perhaps he will have work for you."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P2091226925" "Choose Mongoose"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2740952854" "Mongoose is one tough customer, so if you listen to him you might learn a thing or two."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
