"P2453748264" "Operative Kuzmin"
// ProfessionString :
"P2260718124" "Villain Liason"
// DescriptionString :
"P1295061323" "Operative Kuzmin has been assigned the role of liason to new villains in Mercy Island. He is a serious man who has dedicated his entire life towards the goals of Arachnos.<br><br>Many in Arachnos whisper that he'd sell his family out for Arachnos. Others say he already has."
// LocationString :
// ContactRequiresText :
"P80505785" "Speak with Alan Desslock first. You are dismissed!<br><br><color orange>VEATs must complete Alan Desslock's first mission to gain access to Operative Kuzmin.</color>"
// HelloString :
"P2340922007" "Let's get to work, {HeroName}."
// HelloString :
"P227752809" "Longbow are fools to think they can stand up to our might."
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2289088861" "Do not speak with me, {HeroName}. I have much to do."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2922335827" "{HeroName}, good to see you. We've got a lot of work to do if we're to push Longbow out of Mercy Island."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2251169787" "You and I have nothing left to discuss, {HeroName}. Your destiny is yours for the taking. I look forward to seeing what you do with it."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1427021712" "You would not ask to speak to me if I were doing too much, {HeroName}. Therefore, I will not request anything from you until you have freed yourself from your current engagements."
// ComeBackLaterString :
// FailsafeLevelString :
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P4267905155" "There are other people in Mercy who have some... plans of theirs. You may be interested in meeting with them to see just how you can benefit from their work."
